85
00:04:15,930 --> 00:04:20,100
But if we act with the bias of action,

86
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:23,940
even if we are uncertain around what the results might be,

87
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:27,990
we might find that innovation is at our fingertips.

88
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:32,040
And that there are folks in our system who are hungry

89
